cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "tse_tick"
abstract: "A Python library for parsing, filtering, and querying Nikkei NEEDS tick data from the Tokyo Stock Exchange. Handles multi-era format variations (2016 fixed-width, 2017-2025 CSV) across four data types with automatic detection, batch CLI ingestion to Hive-partitioned Parquet, event-window extraction around per-event reaction anchors, and bilingual column support."
